	"Description": "[size=3]Five slightly altered portraits of Sebastian along with a corresponding overworld sprite. The sleeves\u00A0for his hoodie have also been altered so that they now reach up to his wrists.[/size]\r<br />\r<br />[size=3]I have tested these myself and they seem to work just fine, so if there are any problems please contact me.[/size]\r<br />[size=2]-------------------------------------------------[/size]\r<br />\r<br />[size=2]How to install[/size]\r<br />[b]\r<br />[color=#cc0000]Make back-ups for your original files before changing them, just in case you may want to revert to the original game in the future.[/color][/b]\r<br />\r<br />[list]\r<br />[*]Download the modified XNB\r<br />[*]Find the corresponding XNB file in the game “Content” folder or subfolder\r<br />[*]Replace the original XNB file with the downloaded one.\r<br />[/list]",
